config MTK_LIS3DH
	bool "LIS3DH accelerometer for MediaTek package"
	default n
	help
	  Support for the STMicroelectronics LIS3DH 3-axis accelerometer
	  (I2C, address 0x19) on MediaTek platforms. This driver plugs into
	  the MediaTek accelerometer framework (drivers/misc/mediatek/
	  accelerometer/accel.c) and exposes /dev/m_acc_misc + the
	  m_acc_input input device used by the android sensors HAL.

	  If unsure, say N.
